    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418f66ca69f818b6eeeced76",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――私と貴方をこうして結び付けた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c59e4febb57b0f13e850543435e23973ee57e634b42d799dfe87e1ae477bd867",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da650479ccf2711854cd4df9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自分はトレーナー室で独り，\n梦之旅のデビューに向けた\nトレーニング計画を必死に練っていた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "592a74e50090651c23fe1a8095ff6346e9c091249d1e8dfe4a3d1ff84d19b692",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        70,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/70/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0ef8f2a024df062cc8204b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『君の旅路の果てを見たいから』，か……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a874acffbcc3560ef8317fb4c9c66b29d0ccb90ad8b265ad391be8743cc67b12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        71,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/71/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d6065c4d084b9768384dfc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『貴方の旅路の果てを見たいから』，か……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e21bea29309b62e151e541f520bab9d40f7039861a6355356a91cebe4f70096",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        71,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/71/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:415dac88da0d38760d8cf139",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "半端な仕事では，並外れて聡明な彼女の\n助けになることはできない。\nそう気合いを入れて励んでいたのだが――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecc0891d0b85e9c1898d7bc05ff82aa786855d7a3fb81dc27af7f18ee0f3362a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        71,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/71/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab344855bf45bc5f705c220e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦之旅に言った言葉は，\n決して嘘ではない。だが――",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a50c196279b9312835981a28671be184b8ae1f618d976b5061b981bc567180",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        72,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/72/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d54fc51a3cba657e78982b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "それが彼女に向けて宣言したものかは，\n自信が持てなかった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a60462fab9ff00d01902ac9900fae3cc0d19b7bae063175649ebe20065a58af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        73,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/73/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f9dab8a159d0e3d90a3773",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――あるはずのない香りを確かに感じ，\n心の内に湧き上がるもやがある。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbd741cbc4259ddc31949d120072d9bc51e177bd295c02f2a3676e2a70baf0ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        74,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7cc1dad708ae4bac80cd688",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（――いや，ダメだ……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "abe3fb1624ddfe3db3a3fa4e512b8694f1747b2bc60de37fec27f8c619ef48ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:027bb47626255960739fd2dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "これは恐らく，\n底知れぬ彼女に対しての……――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c24f67ce671b131cff43615bbee5eb82815f916213d311375e3c7c325862353b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd173d71663227744ea8d752",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……見方を，考え方を変えるべきだ。\n確かに梦之旅は，\nその真意をはかるのが難しいウマ娘だが――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b11bafb266a629f8a1d60180856ea1aeea55129f10a049abe1581f0132ca1eaa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        76,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/76/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1eb4c7c511b5d9744ec4a35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "彼女の目的意識。ステイゴールドと\n“一筋の黄金”に対する憧れ。\nそこだけは，常に一貫して真摯だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3e62805bf4d903e5351162a974f10a87eb522cca667c07d455f93517f1a355c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        77,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/77/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f0f93621e71b3f2aef93c93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "そして……\n自分が，梦之旅の走りに\n夢を見たことも，不変の事実だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac3276dd7aa8d51d9c539181bd85df76d22d4c2033404bbc627ec7bf938a9983",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        78,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/78/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86a7319c08a2fc2b0be3ca85",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……やるぞ！自分の仕事を！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "78c38808491d9350394238e8d148a8287217faab2615dffb5b0f84836f0584b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        79,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/79/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157162d8f334215300d91a6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "トレーナーとしてそれさえわかっていれば，\n何も問題はない……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61a23dcc31a3cbbbd2e2de9b8bd9b46164377d861e01a140756ea5c2ca846a3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        79,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/79/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10e98dfc2c2557387fdd0e9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……そうだね",
      "source_fingerprint": "49df1f3610d9361f97d02d32d24f52ae57810e6f2c36e063773f05e276145e7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
